CSL files under src/layout.csl, src/meshgemm.csl, and src/comm_lib/ are
unmodified copies of MeshGEMM/src from that repository (SDK 2.10 / WSE-3).
src/layout_fp32.csl, src/meshgemm_fp32.csl, and src/comm_lib/comm_pe_fp32.csl
are an Ozaki-side FP32 port of those kernels (@fmacs / @mov32).
src/layout_fmachs.csl and src/meshgemm_fmachs.csl keep FP16 A/B tiles and
the FP16 fabric, and accumulate C with @fmachs into FP32. Host launchers
wrap all three with the ozaki-roofline timing and float64 accuracy
contract. The SUMMA kernels under benchmarks/gemm_summa are unchanged.
src/layout_fused.csl and src/meshgemm_fused.csl run one MeshGEMM
schedule with four @fmachs products per two-hop step.
